      "Safranin Target: Lignified walls, xylem tracheids/vessels, and sclerenchyma stain bright red.",
      "Fast Green Target: Cellulosic walls, parenchyma, and phloem stain green.",
      "Stage Micrometer Division: Standard division is exactly 0.01 mm (10 \\mu m).",
