      "Dissection of Moss Antheridial & Archegonial Heads: Teasing apex of male *Funaria* shoot in water; identifying club-shaped antheridia with single-layered jacket and opercular cap interspersed with sterile multicellular multicellular capitate Paraphyses; teasing female shoot to locate flask-shaped archegonia.",
      "Study of Lichen Thallus (T.S.): Examining cross-section of foliose lichen (*Parmelia*): upper cortex (dense fungal hyphae), algal zone / phycobiont layer (*Trebouxia* green algae or *Nostoc*), medulla (loosely woven hyphae), lower cortex with rhizines anchoring to substratum.",
      "Plant Physiological Experiments (Photosynthesis): Demonstrating oxygen evolution during photosynthesis using hydrilla funnel experiment; testing for starch production in variegated leaves (*Coleus*) using iodine solution after ethanol chlorophyll de-pigmentation.",
