      "Stereomicroscope Advantage: Provides 3D stereoscopic depth perception ideal for fine dissections.",
      "Janus Green B Specificity: Supravital stain specific for functional mitochondria.",
      "Methylcellulose Role: High-viscosity agent used to slow down rapidly swimming *Paramecium* on glass slides.",
      "Invertebrate Saline Concentration: 0.65% to 0.7% NaCl for freshwater invertebrates and amphibians.",
      "Mammalian Saline Concentration: 0.9% NaCl (isotonic to mammalian erythrocytes).",
      "Menthol Narcotization: Gradually relaxes contracted molluscan foot and earthworm body wall.",
      "Dissection Pin Placement: Angle pins outward at 45 degrees to avoid obstructing viewing field.",
      "CPCSEA Mandate: Enforces ethical standards and humane alternatives to animal dissections in education.",
      "Wax Pan Care: Heat wax gently; never boil or allow paraffin to catch fire.",
