      "Temporary Mount of Earthworm Setae: Cutting small strip of ventral body wall; boiling gently in 10% KOH; washing and mounting in glycerin; examining S-shaped chitinous setae with nodulus under microscope; confirming role in substrate traction.",
      "Dissection of Cockroach Digestive System: Removing wings and terga of *Periplaneta americana*; exposing alimentary canal: mouthparts \\to pharynx \\to crop (large storage sac) \\to gizzard / proventriculus (lining with 6 internal cuticular teeth for mastication) \\to 6-8 hepatic caeca (secreting digestive enzymes) \\to midgut / mesenteron \\to 100-150 fine yellow Malpighian tubules \\to hindgut (ileum, colon, rectum).",
