      "Interphase Biochemical Events: G1 Phase (presynthetic gap: RNA and protein synthesis, organelle duplication); S Phase (synthesis phase: nuclear DNA replication doubling DNA content from 2C to 4C while chromosome number remains 2n, centrosome duplicates in cytoplasm); G2 Phase (postsynthetic gap: synthesis of tubulin and spindle proteins, ATP generation).",
